{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2023-07", "window": 2, "start_date": 1688774400, "end_date": 1689465599, "month_true_total": 207, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:22:14 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "142144716", "author": {"steamid": "76561198256485964", "personaname": "Exiter Black", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/iwillrevengeu/", "num_games_owned": 439, "num_reviews": 90, "playtime_forever": 1822, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1461, "last_played": 1770408545, "avatar": "4f8204c32ff7f3723d70516b9c04cb262447d9be"}, "language": "english", "review": "Aliens: Fireteam Elite is a game that's nearly great but ends up falling short\n\nIt's in no way a bad game, no matter all the people who want to say so. I enjoyed it enough on Game Pass to decided to grab it on sale on Steam\n\nIf you enjoy 4 player horde shooters, you could do a lot worse, it's a fun game and respect to the developer for their attention to detail with the source material\n\nMy major gripes are no voice/text chat, no drop in/out multiplayer and no dedicated servers\n\nA fun way to spend a weekend if you can grab it on sale", "timestamp_created": 1689442382, "timestamp_updated": 1689446828, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142139507", "author": {"steamid": "76561198178665182", "personaname": "GHRamsEy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GHRamsEy/", "num_games_owned": 83, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 2902, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1607, "last_played": 1785784607, "avatar": "2729f99f992239c8ff32d7dee95536e6a1f33d2c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun for the most part.  Very rough till characters level up.  And some missions require higher level\n character or you are just dead with non-human players aka Bot players.    Bot characters are in many \ncases are not helpful enough.  Don't think of using them in more than standard battle mode.\n\nCoop matchmaking is kinda bad. Casual and Standard coop matchmaking is spotty to non-existent. \nI have not yet played Intense or greater b/c I need to level up my characters more before I do.\nSo there's a catch-22. Can't level up b/c bot team mates and can't get human team mates below standard.\n\nI understand there is a discord server which is supposed to help with matchmaking but one should not be required to use a third -party program to get matchmaking that should be included natively in the game.", "timestamp_created": 1689437098, "timestamp_updated": 1689437098, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142134498", "author": {"steamid": "76561198019104867", "personaname": "Blueboy93", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198019104867/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1378, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 710, "last_played": 1689725241, "avatar": "421263f1fc672690ed65fff79a842354bbb42359"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty fun, left 4 dead with gears of war controls. my girlfriend loves it.", "timestamp_created": 1689432236, "timestamp_updated": 1689432236, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded"